47901f, https://si.imgix.net/51d40e9f/uploads/origins/0850ee90-0f9d-4df7-8c1a-ac589fc5b5ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e6e023fc8f821a30c9f83759e44e4c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51d40e9f/uploads/origins/0850ee90-0f9d-4df7-8c1a-ac589fc5b5ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45f7f64f2328340daeef9e7358597089 3x"}, "body": "初めまして、先生！先生の素晴らしい画風に深く感銘を受け、私が創作したオリジナルキャラクター「赤星」のイラスト制作をお願いしたく存じます。\n\n【キャラクター詳細と参考資料は下記URLに掲載しております】\n\n赤星はハーフサキュバスの血を受け継ぐ少年で、辛い過去を持ちながらも常に明るさを失わない前向きな性格です。\nご都合の良い形で、男性本体・性転換（女性版）、あるいは両バージョンをご一緒にご創作いただければ幸いです。\n\nハーフサキュバスとしての魅力が作品に反映されれば大変嬉しく存じます。衣装については参考資料をそのまま採用していただいても、先生の解釈で自由にアレンジしていただいても結構です。\n\nどうぞよろしくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/112S2o3aSeSj_10dHGb5zjehzWp-1yQnm", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 3565980, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=655336aa7393522bfad1231449d70f77", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=655336aa7393522bfad1231449d70f77, https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62f4bdd75bb72bef45643f3d6f10a582 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10e10ef45464f0b7f6779b289b681285 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f39a77ed9170f8e438b49e93563d0ce8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f39a77ed9170f8e438b49e93563d0ce8, https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91aa18bb9db2fa885ab22d9c5d5d1ba8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b806aeab/uploads/origins/a884c603-fc2f-4704-b3c7-72aeb90e6d31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=697146b96892818647fa79a5838f24df 3x"}, "body": "Hello teacher!\nI really love your work and I was wondering if you would be willing to illustrate my OCs!\n\nThe introduction of the characters and reference images are attached below.\nDaily interactions and any other kind of atmosphere are welcome! (Serious or gag, I would be happy to draw freely according to your interpretation!)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1smgqsu_LYhcnA1bdIlQ3eCohw8XWRabJ\n\nReference for world view: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zhwi4WvrCnIEN2yuHWh-VNOA9SVmK9_D\n\nAny combination is fine! I hope you will feel free to draw any combination you like, without being bound by the constraints of the name!\nYou do not have to be bound by my description. I am very much looking forward to your interpretations and arrangements!\nIf you have any differences or rough drafts of your work, I would be very happy if you could send them to me along with your work if possible.\nI would appreciate it if you could send me the final delivery in PSD format!\nWe hope you will consider our proposal! If you accept my offer, I will give you a five-page thank you...! 😽❤️‍🔥", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 2563390, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25bd175669d613671f137a1a49b8573e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25bd175669d613671f137a1a49b8573e, https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4a2513640e215a832f4f1969a1c885c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7b79b76d634dca4fc4695723c46c05d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bb7a85cc1188eea853d238b2c5699ac", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bb7a85cc1188eea853d238b2c5699ac, https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d96f852bcaf5ad8402d286af3532ce79 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92eb34a8/uploads/origins/fbdcc1b8-7dc5-4f8b-a54b-d73b549cd996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b8fc1170cb8b89914e4a4225adbeb096 3x"}, "body": "🌊先生、こんにちは！\n可愛いのと怖いの、両方描ける先生の画風が大好きです！もし可能であれば、私の創作男女を描いていただけないでしょうか。\n難しければキャンセルして大丈夫です~\n\n▼参考リンクでは、キャラクターの設定など、絵の参考情報をご覧いただけます。\n\n▼キャラクターなど：\n男=D（Andy），女=R（若安琳）\n『ハンガー・ゲーム』や『バトル・ロワイアル』のようなサバイバルゲームを舞台にした物語です。 二人はチームメイト。 (ちょっと曖昧かもしれませんが...)\nロケ地は主に森の中です。\nどちらも30歳前後成熟した大人! Dは筋肉質（ロシア人）、Rはぽっちゃり系。\nDは活発な善人を装った殺人鬼、Rは人見知りしやすく、生き残るために苦労している外科医。\nより日常的な場合：Dが親密な交流を始め、Rはその主導権に圧倒され、恥ずかしがるでしょう。（笑vs赤面...）\nより怖い場合：Dが悪役の顔を晒す←これを知ってショックを受けるR。（圧倒されるかもしれないし、彼と対峙することになるかもしれない）\n\n要するに、犬のふりをした悪い猫D & 働き者の子犬R。真面目に地獄から抜け出そうとする善良な女が、一見無害だが実はかなり悪質な男に取り憑かれる（この用語は正確ではないかもしれない。 しかし、私が言いたいのは、彼女はこの男を簡単には追い出せないということだ。）というストーリーは、おそらくこんな感じなのだろう！\n\n▼内容など：\nお二人を完全にご自身のスタイルで描いていただいて構いません。キャラクターの体型や年齢も特に気にしなくて大丈夫です。\nSkebの作品ページを見ていて、ちょっとSDっぽいバランスに感じて、とても可愛かったです！おまかせを希望します...！なんでもいいんです。\n服のデザインは自由に変えることができます。ポーズや表情も自由です。\n\n私の依頼を考慮していただき、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Bf64h9wMoueFd43YA-UAL-PjWzrUGVRE?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/557cadb0/uploads/origins/70cf4f2b-a102-44e0-838c-285e77b78b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=82446668171592c5619e5b96d05d25fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/557cadb0/uploads/origins/70cf4f2b-a102-44e0-838c-285e77b78b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=82446668171592c5619e5b96d05d25fe, https://si.imgix.net/557cadb0/uploads/origins/70cf4f2b-a102-44e0-838c-285e77b78b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1523507525f1313e5554268bbe6fe7be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/557cadb0/uploads/origins/70cf4f2b-a102-44e0-838c-285e77b78b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bef244322c660a8b518725de98500e7a 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 3154472, "nc": 144}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 1977204, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f73551f30138b61a76382c70593aef7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f73551f30138b61a76382c70593aef7, https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=966330e9491c161613bbd7a414cb8776 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e544a65c8a04dbe4061502d91c0794a5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9629f257f33550a524116286acad851", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9629f257f33550a524116286acad851, https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7d9993fe0eb9e6a7eceee574264a8108 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a467e77/uploads/origins/6fa4db2e-d4ca-4226-ab29-cae187932cf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f19342e90ae038356a6d765a1480f95c 3x"}, "body": "Hello teacher! I love the characters you have drawn. I would like to ask you to illustrate my original character.\n\n[Character Setting]\n[Night White - Witch of the Forest (brown-haired girl)]\nA forest witch with an active personality and a mischievous spirit. Yohaku has a sly side, and often shows a mischievous and devilish expression beneath her bright exterior. She is a girl in appearance, but her actual age is a mystery.\nNight White lives deep in the forest, where it is rumored that she has a jewel that can grant any wish. When many people try to take it from her, she uses her magical powers to turn them into animals and then transfers them to a kingdom near the forest.\nOne day, she meets a bowman from the kingdom, Ninto, who has come to take the treasured gem. Yohaku is intrigued by the fact that he feels a different magical power from humans and that her transformation magic does not work on him. From then on, Yohaku occasionally visits Oshidoh in the kingdom, and she gives him a lot of trouble.\n\n[Shinito - Archer (red-haired boy)]\nA calm but shy archer. He has excellent archery skills and lives near the Kingdom of Humankind with his sister (Oshizuki), a diplomat. Compared to his outspoken sister, Oshidotsuki does not express himself very well and always hides his true emotions.\nOne day, he was ordered by the king to go to the forest in search of a treasured gem. Although he excelled at archery, he could not resist the powerful magic of the forest witch and had to retreat temporarily. He is not good at expressing his emotions and tends to be the target of Yohaku's pranks, but his reactions are a source of amusement for Yohaku.\n\nI would be happy to include line drawings, practice drawings, or immersed roughs in the PSD if you have any.\nIf you don't want to draw it, you can cancel the request directly.\nThank you for viewing!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1c-RJoFSOoFA9CkDsr0h9ETjFX9j5m81D", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 3595432, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fcb5789aff6e121c541a3fd8517534e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fcb5789aff6e121c541a3fd8517534e, https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1fa633f1e4e7470041da8b408d8ac08 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c70f86e3eaa42d802fde7b6f823ce57 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ceaa50c7a0705d43a7f8a55b2f39ead", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ceaa50c7a0705d43a7f8a55b2f39ead, https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc19024e2b86cbea7c8a282a95ca0081 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db8935ed/uploads/origins/a6f93461-73b8-4ae5-9e08-d777b3e9c32c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3cabcd52c82fe76e7434269a3825e84 3x"}, "body": "🌊🌊🌊🌊 adults! I love your work so much！！！！！！！！ 😭😭😭😭😭😭💖💖💖🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺please let me eat。。。。。。。\n\nMy two OCs are in the link below!\nThis is Ushiro and a high school student! The age difference is only a few years and the relationship is stepfather and son, but the relationship is very vague!\nOffense: Takinashimasu Masu Bungetsu\nUshiro is a frivolous type, with dyed white blonde hair, and his original hair color is black, not brown! He likes to tease others and loves to stick to them tightly. His eyes look at his partner very gently and he has a tear bruise under his left eye. There are openings on both sides of his shirt sleeves!\nReceiver: Wataruma Takinashimashi\nHe is a relatively calm type of character, usually feeling helpless towards his opponents and not very expressive, but he loves them! Her attitude toward him is not like a father, but like an uncle, etc. Their relationship is very good. His eyes are also relatively calm.\n\nThe movement should look more intimate in the aggressive way!\nIf you are not comfortable with the drawing, you may cancel! If the amount does not match, I will send another request!\n\nReference image of the character:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--k4zWozxSyVJQvr33CYFbGSzDEJv_0-\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--k4zWozxSyVJQvr33CYFbGSzDEJv_0-", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sky90852847/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3500394, "client_id": 143699, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75d21cdf/uploads/origins/d37c4b4c-5f39-4ad5-8006-1b91cd11b42a?bg=